#   Bauchladen (clinical)    Schmidt 1985-present (*Liebes-affäre
#                            zwischen Problem und Lösung*, Carl-Auer).
#                            The typed display @fate browses.
#
# Spec context: docs/specs/bauchladen-autopoietic-fate.md §4 (the
